// ENERGY-CONSERVING, and that is the whole discipline here. These sums feed a
// smoothstep, so the mean of the result — the frame's total white — is a
// function of the sum's DISTRIBUTION. The octaves are independent, zero-mean and
// identically distributed (they are all odyGnoise in different frames), so the
// variance is Σw² and holding Σw² fixed holds the white budget fixed while the
// structure gets finer. ODY_LACE_K is exactly that: sqrt(1 − w²/Σw²) over the
