  // it R is effectively constant across a 10 m frame and the edge is a smooth
  // curve that rises and falls — which was r1's whole failure. ±1.4 s at 4.5 m
  // means neighbouring stretches are up to a THIRD of a swash period out of
  // step, so the front breaks into overlapping tongues instead of a contour.
