  // when a pixel covers a centimetre. HALVED and retired earlier at r11 — at 7.7
  // cm it is the finest thing on the bed, and at ±0.30 it was beating against
  // the bright caustic filaments in the near field and speckling them into
  // dotted lines. Sand grain is a whisper, not a texture.
  if (fGrain > 0.004) v += odyGnoise(q * 13.0).x * 0.16 * fGrain;
