  // Applied to the wave and not to the finished deposit rate, because that is
  // where the physics is and because the rate is nowhere near linear: at storm a
  // fully breaking texel deposits ~17/s against a 5 s memory, so a quarter of
  // the rate is still fifteen times saturation and an output scale would change
  // nothing at all (measured: the r3 lee frames came back as white as the
  // windward ones). Attenuating the crest instead collapses the DUTY gate below
