  // ── S5: THE BREAKING BAND — deposit, not paint ─────────────────────────────
  // THE SETS. odyShoreSets() is the spine's own swell band re-parameterised on
  // DISTANCE TO THE WATERLINE, so every crest runs shoreward on every bearing,
  // and six components beating against each other give the GROUPS: a few big
  // crests, then a quiet spell. A high threshold on that sum is the whole reason
  // this reads as surf and the old always-on wash read as a carpet — at ~20%
  // duty a fixed stretch of beach is QUIET most of the time.
  //
