  // along-shore coordinate ALONE. Anything varying across-shore is averaged away
  // by the advection — a parcel crosses a 2 m across-shore streak in under a
  // second, so it INTEGRATES that noise instead of sampling it, which is the other
  // half of why r6's wash read as one blown sheet. Along-shore lobes (beach cusps,
  // 3–14 m) travel with the parcel and survive the whole run.
